<title>FINLAND: CAP-SHEKKI SAYS HAS 3,273 SAMPO SHARES.</title>
<headline>CAP-SHEKKI SAYS HAS 3,273 SAMPO SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cap-Shekki kotimaa Oy said in a statement on Tuesday it had bought 3,273 A series shares in insurance company Sampo in its recent offering, where it paid two Viking Line vouchers for each Sampo share.</p>
<p>&quot;Cap-shekki kotimaa aims to sell the shares further,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The shares Cap-Shekki bought in its offering from August 26 to October 26 correspond about 0.02 percent of shares and votes in Vakuutusosakeyhtio Sampo, Cap-Shekki said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
